        <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A mathematical object is an information content entity that is an abstraction in the area of mathematics. It has a formal definition that allows for deductive reasoning and mathematical proofs. [Allotrope]</core:definition>
