        <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A Uniform Resource Locator (URL), colloquially termed a web address, is a reference to a web resource that specifies its location on a computer network and a mechanism for retrieving it. [Wikipedia]</core:definition>
