        <core:changeNote rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">2020-09-24 Changed alt labels. [Allotrope]</core:changeNote>
        <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">The pressure limit is a specification of the maximum pressure that the plumbing system can operate with. [Allotrope]</core:definition>
