        <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A statistics method is a specification (method) for sampling a population, quantification of qualities of the samples and applying statistics on the quantified qualities to produce summary information on the population. [Allotrope]</core:definition>
