        <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Flow rate is a quality quantification facet that quantifies the ratio of the flow going though the plumbing part (port of a divert valve, solvent channel) as part of a total flow. [Allotrope]</core:definition>
