        <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A BET plot is a data distribution function of an adsorption isotherm with 1/v[(p0/p)-1] on the y-axis and p/p0 on the x-axis, where p is equilibrium pressure and p0 saturation pressure of adsorbates at the temperature of adsorption, and v is the adsorbed gas quantity. [Wikipedia]</core:definition>
        <core:prefLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">BET plot</core:prefLabel>
    </owl:Class>
    


