        <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A height equivalent to a theoretical plate is a chromatography peak facet quantifying the ratio of the absorption bed length divided by the number of theoretical plates in the absorption bed. [Wikipedia]</core:definition>
