        <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A peak type is a classification datum that classifies a peak by the role played by the substance it is a proxy for in the chromatographic process. [Allotrope]</core:definition>
        <core:example rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">main component, mobile phase, excipient</core:example>
