        <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A data format conversion software is a software the converts data into a specified target format. [Allotrope]</core:definition>
        <core:prefLabel rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">data format conversion software</core:prefLabel>
