        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">if b is a continuant and if, for some t, cis continuant_part of b at t, then c is a continuant. (axiom label in BFO2 Reference: [009-002])</owl:annotatedTarget>
