        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An atom of an element that exhibits properties that are between those of metals and nonmetals, or that has a mixture of them. The term generally includes boron, silicon, germanium, arsenic, antimony, and tellurium, while carbon, aluminium, selenium, polonium, and astatine are less commonly included.</obo:IAO_0000115>
