        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A benzenedicarboxylic acid carrying carboxy groups at positions 1 and 4. One of three possible isomers of benzenedicarboxylic acid, the others being phthalic and isophthalic acids.</obo:IAO_0000115>
