        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">An epsilon-amino acid comprising hexanoic acid carrying an amino substituent at position C-6. Used to control postoperative bleeding, and to treat overdose effects of the thrombolytic agents streptokinase and tissue plasminogen activator.</obo:IAO_0000115>
