        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Baryon is a fermion that does experience the strong force (strong interaction). The term is derived from the Greek betaalpharhoupsilonsigma (heavy).</obo:IAO_0000115>
