        <obo:IAO_0000115 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A drug that softens, separates, and causes desquamation of the cornified epithelium or horny layer of skin. Keratolytic drugs are used to expose mycelia of infecting fungi or to treat corns, warts, and certain other skin diseases.</obo:IAO_0000115>
