        <core:definition rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">A processual entity that realizes a plan which is the concretization of a plan specification. [IAO]</core:definition>
        <core:example rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#string">Injecting mice with a vaccine in order to test its efficacy</core:example>
